abstract: >-
  ICS/OT supply chain vulnerability scanner: matches asset inventories and SBOMs
  against NVD CVEs and the CISA KEV catalog, scores findings by Purdue level,
  exposure and patchability, and maps remediation to IEC 62443.
keywords:
  - ics
  - ot-security
  - vulnerability-management
  - sbom
  - iec-62443
  - cisa-kev
